
# Assets Module

> Centralized repository for mineral properties, leases, wells, units, operators, and ownership information.

---

# Overview

The Assets module serves as the master record for all mineral properties managed within Oil & Gas OS. It provides a centralized location for storing lease, unit, well, operator, county, and production information that supports the acquisition lifecycle.

Every acquisition opportunity references one or more Assets, ensuring consistent property data across Deals, Mailer Lists, Campaigns, Title Review, Curative, Closing, and Payments.

The Assets module acts as the system of record for land and property information.

---

# Objectives

The Assets module enables users to:

- Maintain accurate mineral asset records
- Organize assets by county and operator
- Track lease and unit information
- Store well and API details
- Link assets to acquisition deals
- Support title examination
- Provide reporting by property

