# Business Rules

## Rule 1

Each Asset must belong to a County.

---

## Rule 2

Each Asset may contain multiple Owners.

---

## Rule 3

Each Asset may be associated with multiple Deals over time.

---

## Rule 4

API Numbers must be unique where applicable.

---

## Rule 5

Archived Assets cannot be modified without Administrator approval.

